---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageBanner from "../components/PageBanner.astro";
import PageCta from "../components/PageCta.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Atlantis"
  description="Atlantis Property Services brings cleaning, gardening, maintenance and property preparation together through one reliable point of contact across Melbourne."
>
  <PageBanner title="Property services should be easier." image="/images/hero-property.jpg" wide />

  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap page-body--narrow">
      <p class="page-intro__text">
        Atlantis Property Services was created around a simple idea: property owners should not have to
        chase multiple providers every time something needs doing.
      </p>
      <p class="page-intro__text">
        Homes, investment properties, apartment buildings and commercial premises rarely need just one
        type of service. They need cleaning. Gardens need maintaining. Things break. Properties need
        painting. Rubbish needs removing. Tenants move in and out.
      </p>
      <p class="page-intro__text">
        Atlantis brings those services together. Instead of starting from scratch every time, our clients
        have one place to contact for the work their property needs. We coordinate trusted, vetted service
        professionals, and we remain your central point of contact from the quote through to any follow-up.
      </p>
      <p class="page-intro__text">
        Whether you need a cleaner once, ongoing garden maintenance, or several services coordinated across
        more than one property, the goal is the same: make property services simpler. You tell us what the
        property needs. We organise the right service and keep you informed.
      </p>
      <p class="page-intro__text">
        Atlantis is Melbourne-based and works across Melbourne and surrounding areas. Enter your postcode
        when you request a quote and we will confirm availability for that location.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <PageCta
    title="One property. Multiple jobs. One call."
    body="Whatever your property needs, start with Atlantis. Tell us what needs doing and we will take it from there."
  />
</BaseLayout>
